  "goodToKnow": "Die Kunstgeschichte is art history, a discipline largely founded in the German-speaking world, from Johann Joachim Winckelmann in the 18th century to Aby Warburg and Erwin Panofsky. Der Kunsthistoriker (die Kunsthistorikerin) is an art historian. Die Kunst means art and skill: Das ist keine Kunst (that's no great feat). Berlin's Museumsinsel is a UNESCO World Heritage Site. It has no plural."
